      "source": "pdf_layout",
      "field": "abstract",
      "raw_text": "We present a new OT-based two-party multiplication proto- col that is almost as efficient as Gilboa's semi-honest protocol (Crypto '99), but has a high-level of security against malicious adversaries without further compilation. The achieved security suffices for many applications, and, assuming DDH, can be cheaply compiled into full security.",
